					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is easily my favorite on this storyline so far. It's a beautiful case of &quot;would've, should've could've&quot; in action. This could have been done better&#8230;but that didn't stop her. Next thing could've been a problem&#8230;not today. The world lost but for a bag of chips and a brokenhearted little girl.</p> <p>+1 Sil. Thanks for the punch in the feels.</p> 
				 	]]>
